msgstr ""

msgid "Ami「......I'm going home.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Me voy a casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? So soon?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿Tan pronto?」"

msgid "Ami「Were you always such a boring man,＿Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Siempre fuiste un hombre tan＿aburrido, Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ngh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ngh......」"

msgid "Ami「Make sure you come to a decision by＿tomorrow! ......Not that I'm expecting＿much.」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Asegúrate de tomar una decisión＿para mañana! ......Aunque tampoco＿espero mucho.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（For the time being, I'll think it over＿carefully on the way home......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Por lo pronto, lo pensaré con cuidado＿de camino a casa......）」"

msgid "Ami「If I keep talking to you, I'll lose＿motivation and it'll be detrimental to＿the plan. I'm going home before that」"
msgstr "Ami「Si sigo hablando contigo, perderé＿la motivación y eso perjudicará el＿plan. Me voy a casa antes de que eso」"

msgid "Ami「happens.」"
msgstr "Ami「pase.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Saying whatever she goddamn likes......＿If she goes and decides to expect＿greatness or disappointment, either」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dice lo que le da la maldita＿gana...... Si decide esperar＿maravillas o decepciones, de cualquier」"

msgid "Ryuuji「way I'm screwed.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「modo estoy perdido.」"
